second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Louisa Hankey's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 47, \"text\": \"\\\"The Unlikely Union: A Tale of Love and Legacy\\\"\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 49, \"end\": 284, \"text\": \"In the esteemed circles of British high society, where titles and traditions held sway, a remarkable marriage took place, one that would bridge two worlds and forge an unbreakable bond between two individuals from distinct backgrounds.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 285, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"This is the story of Louisa Hankey, a member of the peerage, and Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general, whose union would defy convention and cement their places in history.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 586, \"text\": \"Louisa Hankey, born into a family of noble lineage, was no stranger to the intricacies of aristocratic life.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 587, \"end\": 732, \"text\": \"Her family's reputation, built on a foundation of wealth, influence, and public service, had earned them a respected position within the peerage.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 733, \"end\": 850, \"text\": \"As a member of this elite group, Louisa was well-versed in the etiquette and expectations that came with her station.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 851, \"end\": 1028, \"text\": \"Yet, despite the comforts and privileges afforded to her, Louisa's heart yearned for something more – a sense of purpose, a life of service, and a partner who shared her values.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1029, \"end\": 1131, \"text\": \"Enter Matthew Darby-Griffith, a man of unyielding dedication and unwavering commitment to his country.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1132, \"end\": 1317, \"text\": \"As a British Army general, Matthew had spent his career honing his skills on the battlefields of Europe, earning a reputation for bravery, strategic brilliance, and unshakeable loyalty.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1318, \"end\": 1431, \"text\": \"His was a life of duty, discipline, and sacrifice, one that had taken him far from the comforts of civilian life.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1432, \"end\": 1613, \"text\": \"And yet, despite the demands of his profession, Matthew's heart remained open to the possibility of love, of finding a partner who could understand and support him in his endeavors.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1614, \"end\": 1746, \"text\": \"The paths of Louisa and Matthew converged in the early 20th century, a time of great upheaval and transformation in British society.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1747, \"end\": 1927, \"text\": \"As the old certainties of the aristocracy began to crumble, Louisa and Matthew found themselves drawn to each other, their differences in background and profession notwithstanding.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1928, \"end\": 2095, \"text\": \"It was a union that would raise eyebrows among their respective circles, but one that would ultimately prove to be a testament to the power of love and mutual respect.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2096, \"end\": 2172, \"text\": \"The evidence of their marriage is a testament to the strength of their bond.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2173, \"end\": 2353, \"text\": \"Records from the time reveal a deep affection and commitment between the couple, one that would endure through the trials and tribulations of war, social change, and personal loss.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 49, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING ROYAL ROMANCE ROCKS EUROPEAN SOCIETY**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 51, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \"In a stunning revelation that has left the aristocracy and political circles reeling, it has been confirmed that Louisa Hankey, a member of the esteemed British peerage, is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 468, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the family, the whirlwind romance between Hankey and Zwyrtek began in the early 2000s, when the two met at a high-profile charity gala in Prague.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 595, \"text\": \"Despite their vastly different backgrounds, the couple's love blossomed, and they tied the knot in a private ceremony in 2005.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 596, \"end\": 718, \"text\": \"\\\"I was taken aback when I first learned about their relationship,\\\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of Hankey's.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 719, \"end\": 801, \"text\": \"\\\"But as I got to know František, I realized what a kind and genuine person he was.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 802, \"end\": 831, \"text\": \"They were truly meant to be.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 832, \"end\": 986, \"text\": \"Zwyrtek, who served as a member of the Czech Parliament from 1998 to 2012, was known for his tireless work in promoting European unity and social justice.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 987, \"end\": 1127, \"text\": \"His marriage to Hankey, a descendant of the Earl of Hankey, brought together two influential families with a rich history of public service.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1128, \"end\": 1187, \"text\": \"The couple's union was not without its challenges, however.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1188, \"end\": 1318, \"text\": \"Zwyrtek's passing in 2017 left Hankey devastated, but she has continued to carry on his legacy through her own philanthropic work.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1319, \"end\": 1460, \"text\": \"\\\"Louisa has always been a pillar of strength, and František's passing was a tremendous blow to her,\\\" said Sir Edward Hankey, Louisa's cousin.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1461, \"end\": 1575, \"text\": \"\\\"But she has channeled her grief into making a positive impact on the world, just as František would have wanted.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1576, \"end\": 1801, \"text\": \"Data obtained from the Czech Ministry of the Interior reveals that Zwyrtek and Hankey jointly founded the Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation in 2010, which has since provided critical support to marginalized communities across Europe.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1802, \"end\": 1858, \"text\": \"In a statement, the foundation's executive director, Dr.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1859, \"end\": 1926, \"text\": \"Helena Nováková, praised the couple's commitment to social justice.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1927, \"end\": 2077, \"text\": \"\\\"František and Louisa's love was a beacon of hope for many, and their foundation has made a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2078, \"end\": 2158, \"text\": \"We will continue to honor their legacy and strive for a more equitable society.\\\"\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2159, \"end\": 2277, \"text\": \"As news of the marriage spreads, the European aristocracy and political elite are abuzz with excitement and curiosity.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Louisa Hankey\", \"scope\": \"Spouse\", \"claim\": \"Louisa Hankey's spouse is Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general.\", \"answer\": \"Matthew Darby-Griffith\", \"quote\": \"This is the story of Louisa Hankey, a member of the peerage, and Matthew Darby-Griffith, a decorated British Army general, whose union would defy convention and cement their places in history.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Louisa Hankey\", \"scope\": \"Spouse\", \"claim\": \"Louisa Hankey is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician.\", \"answer\": \"František Zwyrtek\", \"quote\": \"In a stunning revelation that has left the aristocracy and political circles reeling, it has been confirmed that Louisa Hankey, a member of the esteemed British peerage, is married to the late František Zwyrtek, a prominent Czech politician.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Matthew Darby-Griffith\", \"František Zwyrtek\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Matthew Darby-Griffith\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"František Zwyrtek\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
